        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5RWVrRklTR1Z3YlVWSFdHMUlOalJFYkZKTFdWRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5RWVrRklTR1Z3YlVWSFdHMUlOalJFYkZKTFdWRRAB!2m1!1s0x3403f1cd75089d05:0xcfecd8e72bd528"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJBZ0Idc3xAzQRKNUr59jszwA/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aVVJ6VmpTMlpUTVdvMFQwMHpVRXczTm1WTmEzYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 個月前",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "見 Google 評分幾高，加上自己之前都食過幾次，拉麵叫做正常水平，但一試佢其他嘢結果真係幾失望。叫咗親子丼午餐加一，成百蚊一餐，但份量同質素都完全唔值。蛋少到幾乎感受唔到親子丼應有嘅滑蛋感，雞肉冰鮮味幾重，而且口感又鞋又乾，似翻叮多過即煮。成碗飯賣相都唔吸引，見到已經冇乜胃口。餃子只係普通，救唔返個飯，以呢個價錢食晏大把選擇，要食都揀返拉麵。唔明點解 Google 評分可以咁高。今次食完只會覺得中伏，唔會再幫襯。我寧願食丸龜製麵。",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
